\newlabel{tab:mot_system}{{2}{5}{System-level agreement on nuScenes val150 (cache replay; class-agnostic association, 2.0\,m gate). OV-TCS, computed without GT identities, ranks the two systems identically to HOTA, IDF1, and AMOTA (official devkit)}{table.2}{}}
