\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Associator sensitivity. Top: OV-TCS vs.\ each association parameter (others at default); curves shift levels but never cross --- the method ordering is invariant. Bottom: normalized sensitivity per metric; association parameters move OV-TCS strongly and mAP not at all.}}{6}{figure.4}}
\newlabel{fig:sweep}{{4}{6}{Associator sensitivity. Top: OV-TCS vs.\ each association parameter (others at default); curves shift levels but never cross --- the method ordering is invariant. Bottom: normalized sensitivity per metric; association parameters move OV-TCS strongly and mAP not at all}{figure.4}{}}
